# 708.3), not how it is at the end step. Turn 3 the Shrieker attacks and manifests dread (Snapcaster Mage face down); in the second
# main phase Hauntwoods Shrieker's ability ({1}{G}) turns the Mage face up. At the end step the Tipster still gets its counter.

